ta keśavārjunā || 

saṃjaya uvāca || 

ubhāyārathamā (*****)(?)sāntamo(?) | 
(*********) kṣarakāsva manuttama (*****) (?) bhrāṃ (*)(?)vata niyama kṛtāvubhau |

tasmiṃ pitṛgaṇaṃ pūjyaniviṣṭau sulakṣaṇau ||

ekānte ca (*****) (?)lyate ca parasparam |

kṛtāṅjalipuṭi (**)(?) arjunāvākyamavravīt ||


arjuna uvāca ||

sainyayorubhayorūḍhā udyato yuddhapāṇayaḥ |
śaṅkhatūryaiśca bheriśca siṃhanāda ha(?)teradhau ||

gītayā kathitampūrvaṃ vyākulestasya me name |
nāvadhāritayā kṛṣṇa tajjñeyaṃ mamaraṃ padam ||

pūrvayuddhe svayameva punaḥ punare(?) bhāṣase |
cchindabhindavadhasveti rājyakuryāda ka (*)(?)ka ||

pradhānaśatrū vākyeti vadhayastu marindamaḥ |
jñāna tena punarvaktya sarvaśatru vadhe kṛte ||

bhagavānuvāca |

yathā na lipyate pārtha punaḥ pāpaiḥ kathañcana |
yogayuktaṃ sa vijñānampaścāccetkathayāmyaham ||

<p. 2>

arjuna uvāca ||


havvā sahodarā bhrātṛjñātīnāñca kulakṣayam |
bhītāsmiṃ narakasyehaṃ jñeyaṃ kathayasva me ||

kathaṃ jñāna kathaṃ jñeyaṃ paramātmā kathambhava |
ātmānamvai kathañcehamantarātmā kathambhavet ||

sarvametat samākhyāhi yathā jñāsyanti tatvataḥ |
ye nāhaṃ yogayuktātmā duṣkṛtaṃ tarayāmyaham ||

saṃsārasāgarai ghore putradārauharākule |
jñāti vāndhavamīnārmerartha grāhabhayāvahe ||(?)

agādhe me plabdha(?) durge mahāpātaistu dustara |
majjayānāṃ ca mātrā hi yasmiṃ saṃsārasāgare ||

kulālamiva vajrasya suḥkhaduḥkhamaśeṣataḥ |
svarganarake bhramacchīghraṃ cakradātāhataṃ ||

yathātvaṃ abdasyapi(?) vā āgacchanti vrajanti ca |
evaṃ sarvajagatkṛṣṇa bhramanti saṃsārasāgarāt(?) ||

jñānaṃ me kathaya kṛṣṇa yena sūyāga(?)sambhava |
jñātaṃ me kathaya kṛṣṇa yena tūryā(?) sambhava ||

upa(?) saṃ(?) na hisāṃ sā hi saraṇā (*****) ||

tā (**********)(?) |

<p. 2b>

yasyāhaṃ prāvayiṣyāmi prasīda mama mādhavaḥ |
yasya taṃ lokanāthasya sadā tu graho (***)(?) ||

tena(?) rahiraṃmadurga nātrakārya vacāraṇāḥ |(?)
tadyevayamida (***)(?) namparamadurlabham ||

ye nāhaṃ puṇyapāpebhyo na vadhnīyā kadācana |


bhagavānuvāca ||


hantate kathayiṣyāmi (**) (?) kha sukhāvaha |
yathā na lipyate karmai padmapatramivāmbhasi ||

śarīrepi sthitannityaṃ na vindantya vibodhataḥ |
sa eva na tatasyānta taṃ jñeyaṃ mamaraṃ padaṃ ||

yaṃ prāpya līyate jīvā yaṃ prāpyaṃ sṛjate punaḥ |

kṣaṇe kṣaṇena kaunteya tajñeyamamarampadam |
mānteṣā(?) kṣīṇameṣāṣṭā bhāgokṣaṇa kṣaṇa dvayaṃ ||

tuṭi tuṭi lavaṇa dvayonimiṣāṣṭādaśabhiḥ |
prāṇo vinābhikānāṃ ṣaṣṭiṃ bhinnāṃbhikā proktā ṣaṣṭibhinnā āvahate nisi |
a (**)(?) bhava deveśau na mṛyetva kṣaret punaḥ |
sthāvarā jaṅgamā jīvā upajīvanti taṃ sadā ||

usvasaṃ nisvasaṃ tasthāyaṃ prānamivartate |

<p. 3a>

tena(?) hi(?) (*)(?) kajarādviśvaṃ vyāpinyā yā sthitaṃ prabhuḥ |
remṛsamālamaṅkṛtvā jihvādantāntare sthitaḥ ||

svayaṃ muccarite yastu (**)(?) brahma viṣṇu(?) ducyate |
ka(?)tare sthūla me nābhi(?) kṣarate ca punaḥ punaḥ ||

yāsau parāparā svasthānakṣara vyāpakastadā |
lakṣaṅkṛtvā paraśānte ekacittamanaṃdhatuḥ ||

uccāryantena bāṇena binduḥ paramayoginaḥ |
yāvaduccarate hyātmā sakalastu kalaissaha ||

kalātī (**)(?)tasthāyaṃ layaṃ gacchati rañjate |
tatrasthā bhūyabhūyāpyeka cittamanaṃ dhanu ||

kṣaṇe naikena mucyeta kiṃ punaḥ satataṃ naraḥ |
uccāryantu paraṃ jñātvā abhāvabhāvanāṃ kuru ||

bhramaraḥ kusumo saktaḥ tathā yogaparāyaṇaḥ |
dahantyaktvā vrajedyastu sarvabhāvānvibhāvayet ||

yāga yuktamatindri(?) ca(?) para(?)nirvāṇamāpnuyāt |(?)
yasya gamena (*)(?) tadā paṭhate granthavistarāḥ ||(?)

nava(*)viṭye(?) prājñaḥ paraṃ sukhamavāpnuyāt |(?)

<p. 3b> vedasya vindanaṃ nāma yo vetti paramaṃ padam |
yastaṃ vindati vedajña sa bhaved vedapāragaḥ ||

vedā vindati tatvajña vedaśāstra (*)(?) tatparāḥ |
parama brahma iti jñātvā sa bhaved vedapāragaḥ ||

tṛsthānaśca tṛmātraśca tṛbrahmaśca tṛrakṣaram |
arddhamātrārddha yo vetti sa bhaved vedapāragaḥ ||

veda viduṣastu yo viprau brahmavidyaparāyaṇaḥ |
paraṃ vattaḥ sa vijñāya sa pūjyanāraye jagat ||

yasmin daśevasadyogī sa deśaḥ paratāṃ vrajet |
bhuñjate sakṛdapyevaṃ sa kulambā dhṛto bhavet ||

āgamo jñāna nityā ca vijñeyaśca tadā gamaiḥ |

jñeyaśca tattvato jñātvā tyajet satvamaśeṣataḥ |
jñeyaṃ jñātvā tyajejjñānaṃ cchandasatvantathaiva ca ||(?)

palālamiva dhānyādhī tyajedgranthamaśeṣataḥ |(?)
ulkahasto yathā (*) svi(?) dravyamālokyatā vrajet ||(?)

<p. 4a> jñānena jñeyamālokya tato jñānamparityajet |
yathāmṛtena tṛptasya kṣīraṇāsti prayojanam ||

evaṃ tatva pa (*)(?) jñātvā vede nāsti prayojanam |
vedeyājñaistapyaindānai kṛyāśakti na hinsayā ||

mokṣastu na bhave teṣāṃ janmamṛtyu punaḥ punaḥ |
paṭhitvā caturāvedā dharmaśāstrāṇyanekadhā ||

yajñeyaṃ nābhi vindanti sarve te paśavasmṛtā |
ātmānaṃ yena vindanti paśupāśairvimohitāḥ ||

bhramantyastu ciraṃ kālaṃ yānyonenaika sahasraśaḥ |
asvamedhai svadhaiḥ santyaiḥ tīrthairdānaissamairapi ||

paramātmā viduryastu tasyāsanaiva pūrayet |
tapteva sasataṃ sā (*) ekapādahastinonaraḥ ||(?)

ekadhyānena yogīnāṃ samametanna saṃśayaḥ |
agni (**)(?) dibhiryajñe yena yaṣṭaṃ sa dakṣiṇam ||

<p. 4b> ekadhyānena yogīnāṃ samametanna saṃśayaḥ |
pṛthicchā(?) sarvato vānastato suci samantataḥ ||

eka (**) (?) yogīnāṃ samametanna saṃśayaḥ |
brahmacaryadagha(?) satya ahinsā lakṣaṇena tu ||

ekadhyānena yogīnāṃ samametanna saṃśayaḥ |
kṣara (*)(?)tāni sarvāṇi kurvanti gatirāgati ||

yogino tatva vidyastu na kṣareta paraṅgataḥ |
nātyantu bhukṣitaścaiva nānyantanimunena tu ||

durmanāvyākulo yasya tasya yogo na sidhyati |
śarīraṃ susthitaṃ yasya manaṃ somya tathaiva ca ||

nirtayoniratu kṣārī tasya yāgastu sidhyati |(?)


bhagavānuvāca ||


jīvaṃ tṛdhā sthitakāyedātmāduccaritasvayam |
nadate paramātmātmā karṣaṇāntanātmani ||

<p. 5a> pūrakaḥ kumbhakaścaiva recakasva vidhīyate |
yāgasyaitāni nāmāni tṛdhāsāramate paraḥ ||

vāyustejastathākāsa tṛtīya jīva u (**) (?) |
jīvaprāṇamiti proktaṃ vālāgrasata kalpitam ||

śabdamūrtimayaḥ prāṇāhṛdyākāseṣu muccarai |
pūritattena sarvāṅga pūrakastu taducyate ||

āpūyamānamacalaṃ pratiṣṭhaṃ visvarūpeṇa saṃsthitam |
niścala sthira bhūtātmā kumbhakastena ucyate ||

caritaṃ yena sarvatra trailokya sacarāram |
sarvabhūtātmakaḥ śambhurevakastu vidhīyate ||

brahmāṇa pūrakamvidyā kumbhako viṣṇurucyate |
recakai śaṅkaraścaiva tṛvidhādhāraṇā smṛtaḥ ||

puṇyapāpa vinirmuktā muktirākāśamātmikā |
eka mūrti trayo bhāgo brahmaviṣṇumaheśvaraḥ ||

sahajāgantukairpāsaiḥ nairodhika samudbhavaiḥ |
baddha samucyate  nedyaḥ tatvabheda kṛtena tu |

arjuna uvāca ||

kathante sahajā pāsanairodhika kathambhavet |
āgantunā(?) kathaṃ kṛṣṇa kathamekastu līyate ||(?)

bhagavānuvāca ||

śabdasparśaśca rūpaśca rasogandhastu paśvame |
manobuddhirahaṅkārā aṣṭabhirvai sthitamparaḥ |
etadgaṇaparā muñce na gaṇātmañca te param ||

bhāṇḍe bījaṃ yathā nyastaṃ kṣaṇamekaṃ na muñcati |

garbhate svarga madhye ca narakambāmba karmabhiḥ |
yadā sa bhavate janmatairguṇai sahitā bhavet |

arjuna uvāca ||

bhinna paścātmake dehe gatā pañca supañcadhā |
prāṇairvimukta dehasya puṇyapāpakṣa tiṣṭhati ||

bhagavānuvāca ||

pṛ.yeṣu ṣveṣu svakṛtaṃmapṛyeṣu ca duṣkṛtam ||

visṛṣṭa dhyanayogīnāṃ brahmamadhya sanātanaḥ |
puṇyapāpama (*) ścaiva vya(?)vāmya pañcadevatā ||

jīvena saha gacchanti yāvadehe pratiṣṭhita ||

karmaraṣṭagaṇervaddha tṛdhājīvāstu bhāṇḍayāḥ |
nīyamānastutiḥ pāsaiḥ śubhairvāpya śubhaistathā ||

<p. 6a> 

badhyāstai karmapāsaistu paśavobandhane yathā |
mucyate tasvamātmānaṃ mokṣastathāmvidhīyate ||

eṣānte ru (*) (?) jāpāsānairodhānindriyāṇi ca |
udīrṇāni tu sarvāṇi prakīrṇāni ramanti tu ||

āgantukāpi ye pāśā lobhakrodhasamanvitam |
kāmarāga vikīrṇastu śarīrantamohanti vai ||

evaṃ tṛvidhapāśaistu baddhāmūhyanti jantava |
bhramaṃtyaneka janmāni śubhā nitya śubhāni tu ||

ātmānaṃ yastu paśye tu yogī tu paramampadam |
vighaṭṭayatyeka pāśāṃ ghanāgnīva prabhañjanam ||


arjuna uvāca ||

kathaṃ sañcarate hyāṣā ga (*) ta (*)(?) yathena tu |
utpathekāni sthānāni te sthānekātra tiṣṭhati ||

prāṇināśuśvasaṃkṛtvāniśvaśañca muhurmuhuḥ |
nirgatastu svadehāstu puna pravisate tu kiṃ (?) ||

kva sthānaṃ vrajate tatra kimatha(?)ñca nivartate |
kintā vadātmanāthāyaparāthāya mathāpi vā ||

ekākī sañcarate kintu athavā (***) (?)vāpi vā |
etanme saṃśayaṃ kṛṣṇacchretu marhasyaśeṣataḥ ||

bhagavānuvāca ||

jāgrasvapnaṃ susupte caiva turya caiva tathā param |
turyāvatkimvā(?) svatañca ṣaṭsthānāni parasya tu ||

jāgre tu hṛdayasthānaṃ kaṇṭhe svapnasamādiśet |
suṣuptaṃ netrayāścaiva tūryantu mūrddhani sthitam ||

na (***)(?) tūryavasthā tu nāsāgraitītameva ca |
evaṃ sañcarate hyātmā yogināntu sadā sthitam ||

jāgre tu brahmaṇaścaiva svapne viṣṇu sadā sthitaḥ |
sthita rudra suṣupteṣu īśvaraḥ tūryamāsthitaṃ ||

sadāsivastu tūryānte tasyātīte paraḥ śivaḥ |
ātmanā nirgama hūtvāne naiva viśane punaḥ ||

sahapūryāṣṭakai gacchai sakalastu kalaissaha |
tyaktvā gamavise hyātmāmamṛtasyā prakāraṇā ||

tasyāgama pakṣantu āgaccha hyātmana prati |
<p. 7a> sarvaiḥ sa (***)(?) bhūyāprāṇānā kāraṇāt  ||(?)

yātaṃ janani yāgā tu sa muktansarva vandhanaḥ |(?)
ajñātvā (**)(?) garbha(?) saṃsārā pacyate bahum ||

