śabdasparśa sva (**)(?) sūlamaṃ(?) gacchati brahmaṇe |
rūparasomanaścaiva viṣṇunīlayatāṃ vrajet ||

ahaṅkāraśca śandhaśca(?) layaṃ gacchanti saṅkaraḥ |
yāśau parāparālīnā amṛtavra(?)ñca gacchati ||

pūraka kumbhakalīnaṃ(?) kumbhā(?)kārecataṃ spṛset |(?)
recakāpi parasānteya utpadamanāmayam ||

yacchate(?) (**)(?)juna(?) kṣiptaṃ kṣīrakṣīra ghṛte ghṛtam |
aviṣeyambhavetadutparamātmānamātmani ||

