arjuna uvāca ||

yatvayā kathitaṃ brahmajñānamparamadurlabham |
arupañcamavijñāna (*********) (?) ||

dhyānayoga sadāścaiva ahanyahani yoginaḥ |
ihatra pratyayaṅkiñci brūhime madhusadanaḥ ||

bhagavānuvāca ||

(*********)gni prajvalanantathā |(?)
tulā puruṣa vijñāna saṭcākrāmaṇameva ca ||(?)

girikṣepicchitebhyāsau jyotidarśana tathā |
(***)(?) tāni yogānāṃ brahmavidyābhyase kṛte |
aṣṭapratyayonyataraṃ siddhistu paradarśane ||

sā siddhi paramājñeyā pratyakṣadarśanena tu |
anyapi vinā jñānantu prajvalayanti yoginaḥ ||

mahākhyāti satvasya agniprajvalanammahat |
vījānāṃ saṃhara tatvena purāhanti dhāpitām ||

saṃharantu tathā caiva punarlaghutarambhavet |

<p. 8>

buddhirmanastvahaṅkāra śabdasya śañcarūpadhyāḥ |
rasagandhāmeva vāṣṭo prāṇā (*****) ||(?)

(*********)(?) kṛto yathā |
praviśeta paradehalayā mṛtakasya tu ||

cālanājñāpanaṅkṛtvā punaḥ śīghraṃ nivarttayā |
sthira buddhiṃ ca sanmūḍhaḥ brahmavidbrahmaṇe ||

svetaḥ piṅgalāyāntu vai nābhyā svapuraṃ pravise punaḥ |
paramānena kartavya praveso nirgamastathā ||

kadāvilamba sā (**)(?)muhu parapuraṃ gataḥ |
ta jñāti sīlo bhavati tasmācchīghraṃ nivartayet ||

prayāga ghaṭikā kṛtvā jihvātala na cchādayet |
sadye (**)(?) bhavati sva (**)(?) yāyena saṃśayaḥ ||

svakāma bhavate mṛtyu na kālavaso bhavet |
anāgatamatīte vā svacchando yogino bhavet ||

(*********)(?)padmāsanaṃ śubhaṃ |
paraśānta layaṃ gacchavimuktayā savandhanaiḥ ||

