<p. 18> duṣkṛtānyekasaḥ kṛtvā mahāpātaka jātyepi ||

agneyaṃ dhāraṇaṃ dhyātvā bhagnī bhavatikāsta(?)vat |
brahmahatyā sahasrāṇi asamyāyamanāni (*****)(?) ||

(*) nena yogena sarvannasyanti tatkṣaṇāt |
yathā mahāsamṛdvāgni vāridhārairnnavāryati ||

yoginā tatvavidyastu varṇāvarṇairnnanāśyate(?) |
bhakṣayitvā viṣaṃ yadvadamantrīṇo va jīvati ||

tathā brahmavido nityaṃ kukarma narakaṃ vaset ||
agādhe saṃlale(?) yadvanimajyeda (*********) ||(?)

abhakṣabhakṣī tathāsau cīnimajye tatvabhirbhinnā |
kāśakārakṛmi yadvadathavatvākṣayaṃ vrajet ||

karmākarmairanekasturaṃtavīvadhvāvatiṣṭhati |
tāvat satpañcāsau cañca japa yajuhutantathā ||

dānādhyayana tīthañca yāvadbrahmanna vindati |
parambrahma viduryastu sarvavyāpi bhavetu saḥ ||

itaresukhaduḥkhāni bhramante nekajanmani |
jñātvātvekākṣaro brahmamātrārekha vivarjitam ||

ācara sarvavarṇeṣu na tu bhakṣamvicārayet |
na mālipyati pāpena puṇyā naiva na lipyate ||

sa yāti dehapatanaṃ yattatpadamanāmayam |
tāvadvarṇa viśeṣastu yāvadbrahma na vindati ||

viditvā tu parambrahma satvavarṇadvijātayaḥ |
yaṃ jñānena hatā smaranti gurubhrātṛ sabāndhavāt ||

cintaghnīstu(?) vanavāsā(?) vāsa(?) (*****) (?) |

brahmavidyā prabhāvena yāga yukta balena ca |
puṇyapāpairvimuktaistu sayāti paramāgati ||

avyasva(?)tava snehena kathitanguhyamuttamam |
ātmā vai svayameva tu jñānenaiva tu labhyate ||

yaṃ jñāne tu japaṃ kuryāna caivā jñāne naiva labhyate ||

ayutanvo(?) sahasre ca yacchatāni tathaiva ca |
(*)(?) horātreṇa yogīnāṃ japasaṃkhyā karoti yaḥ ||

manoranyatra nikṣiptaṃ cakṣuranyatra bhārata |
tathāpi yogināṃ yogo (*****)(?) pravartate(?) |

<p. 19>  eta tatvas (*)(?) nanā(?) jāpya ananya manasārjunaḥ |
jñānināmeṣa jāpyayāṅgajālavimokṣaṇā ||(?)

sthira buddhirasanmūḍhā brahma (*****)(?) |
snātaḥ suci japeyastu vrataniyama parāyaṇā ||

tatsarvaṃ samabhāgantu jñānena tu kṛtaṃ bhavam |
sṛṇuyāva samāsena ṣantidhaṃ(?) yāgalakṣaṇaṃ ||

svayam prāpyaiva vimucyante sarvadvandve dvijāntamaiḥ |
